* A parameter alone in a dc.b string ("\2") with an empty argument: r68 makes no byte (gas read
* the '' it became as a quote character). The dc line is split, each such string in ifnc; a
* label before it on a dz.b 0, in the code or a vsect as the dc.
* fixed: df3f773 2026-10-12 r68togas: section statements only where the section changes; an empty argument in a dc.b string
* expect text: 61626300 00010261 62636162 00636400 01636402 61626364 4e714e71
* expect data: 78000001 02780000
Mk macro
 dc.b "\1",0
Lb\3 dc.b "\2",0
 dc.b 1,"\2",2,"\1"
 dc.b "\2"
 endm
 psect macro_empty_string,0,0,0,0,0
 Mk abc,,X
 Mk ab,cd,Y
 vsect
 Mk x,,Z
 ends
 nop
 ends
